{"type":"text","timestamp":1791296879538,"sessionID":"ses_eee63cde0ffeAifWNmlN8UGdvr","part":{"id":"prt_1119d3938001N9BfgDadahPQaw","messageID":"msg_1119d2b1a001fd0Llxo6NxZ2mY","sessionID":"ses_eee63cde0ffeAifWNmlN8UGdvr","type":"text","text":"All visible tests pass and documented edge cases check out. Bugs fixed:\n\n1. **`ledger/money.py` – `format_cents`**: negative cents used floor division/modulo, so `format_cents(-310)` produced `-$-4.90` instead of `-$3.10`; now formats from `abs(cents)` with the sign prefixed (`-$0.05` style).\n2. **`ledger/parse.py` – `parse_date`**: returned `(y, d, m)` — month and day were swapped; now returns `(year, month, day)`.\n3. **`ledger/report.py` – `top_items`**: sorted totals ascending and returned the smallest n, with no tie-break; now sorts by total descending with ties broken by item name ascending, as documented (`summary_line` inherits the fix).","time":{"start":1791296878904,"end":1791296879527}}}
